  data: {
    LLM: "If you have the Kaiser (3 of Spades), try to get rid of it on a trick that your OPPONENTS win. If you have the Joffre (5 of Hearts), try to save it for a trick your PARTNER is guaranteed to win.\n\nBleeding Trumps: If you win the bid, lead trumps early to exhaust the opponents, making it safer to play the Joffre later.\n\nThe 'Sacrifice': Sometimes it's better to lose a trick with small points than to win it and be forced to lead a dangerous suit that might contain the Kaiser.",
    Player: "If you have the Kaiser (3 of Spades), try to get rid of it on a trick that your OPPONENTS win. If you have the Joffre (5 of Hearts), try to save it for a trick your PARTNER is guaranteed to win.\n\nBleeding Trumps: If you win the bid, lead trumps early to exhaust the opponents, making it safer to play the Joffre later.\n\nThe 'Sacrifice': Sometimes it's better to lose a trick with small points than to win it and be forced to lead a dangerous suit that might contain the Kaiser.",
